+	 * The caller excludes TF, userspace debugging, SMM, CPUID faulting,
+	 * and nested guests. Avoid dispatching back through x86.c to VMX,
+	 * but retain VMCS instruction length, RIP wrap, interrupt shadow,
+	 * and the normal PMU instruction-retirement notification.
